        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The creation directory contains 34 modules, including aliases and variants. Choose a reveal based on what the audience should understand: drawing a boundary explains construction, fading in communicates presence, and transforming a recurring symbol communicates continuity."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Purpose",
            "Animations"
          ],
          "rows": [
            {
              "cells": [
                "Draw and erase",
                "Create, Create3D, Uncreate, DrawBorderOnly, DrawBorderThenFill, TraceBack"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "Typography",
                "Write, Unwrite, Typewriter, TypewriterIn, StaggerWrite"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "Grow and enter",
                "GrowFromCenter, GrowFromEdge, PopIn, SlideIn, DropIn, SpinIn, UnfoldFromCenter"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "Masks and spatial reveals",
                "RevealFromClip, IrisIn, WipeIn, EraseIn"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "Light and assembly",
                "BloomIn, GlowIn, ShimmerIn, CrystallizeIn, ScatterAssemble, MaterializeFrom, BurstIn"
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                "Grouped or signal timing",
                "WaveIn, CascadeIn, BatchIntroduce, TelegraphThenReveal, TransmitIn, AppearInstant"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Each class has its own target restrictions and option type in the creation API reference. The catalog is a selection guide; refer to exact constructor contracts before substituting one animation for another."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Create](/api-animation-creation#create), [Create3D](/api-animation-creation#create3d), [Write](/api-animation#write), [BatchIntroduce](/api-animation-creation#batchintroduce), [Typewriter](/api-animation-creation#typewriter)."
        }
      ]
