    {
      "id": "animation-class-hierarchy",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Follow the animation families"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Animation is the shared timing contract. StateAnimation supplies state interpolation; Sequential and Concurrent compose other animations. Focus on one of those branches to see its descendants, then open a type’s API to check options and behavior before choosing it for your scene."
        },
        {
          "type": "class-hierarchy",
          "root": "Animation",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The [complete class hierarchy](/class-hierarchy?type=Animation#explorer) also includes animation classes from the libraries."
        }
      ]
    },
