        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "MotionPath is a set of path-function factories for state position interpolation. Use arc, Bézier or other factories through AnimOptions.pathFunc. OrbitAnimation, SplineAnimation, SpiralAnimation, LissajousAnimation, ShakeAnimation and SpringAnimation are dedicated animation classes with separate geometry and dynamics options."
        },
        {
          "type": "example",
          "example": "labs/pg-orbitscene"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [MotionPath](/api-animation-motion#motionpath), [OrbitAnimation](/api-animation-motion#orbitanimation), [SplineAnimation](/api-animation-motion#splineanimation), [SpiralAnimation](/api-animation-motion#spiralanimation), [LissajousAnimation](/api-animation-motion#lissajousanimation), [ShakeAnimation](/api-animation-motion#shakeanimation), [SpringAnimation](/api-animation-motion#springanimation)."
        }
      ]
