        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "retiam/highlights contains boundary, backdrop, finish, material and motion emphasis animations. Circumscribe, CornerBrackets, Underline and BoundaryRipple derive geometry from bounds. MarkerSweep and BackdropFade steer attention; ShimmerSweep, SparkleBurst, FlashFinish and Flash mark milestones. ColorTint, PulseGlow, Blink, PopHighlight and WiggleHighlight animate temporary emphasis."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Overlay highlights can create and remove helper geometry, while target-mutating highlights restore captured state on completion. Use a fresh highlight object for each play and avoid simultaneous writers to the same target property."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Circumscribe](/api-libs-highlights-boundary#circumscribe), [MarkerSweep](/api-libs-highlights-backdrop#markersweep), [FlashFinish](/api-libs-highlights-finish#flashfinish), [PopHighlight](/api-libs-highlights-motion#pophighlight)."
        }
